<div class="step"><span class="name">V_line</span><span class="eq">=</span>230 V</div>
<div class="step"><span class="name">I_load</span><span class="eq">=</span>P_load/V_line<span class="eq">=</span><span class="subst">3.6 kW/(230 V)</span><span class="eq">=</span><span class="result">15.6522 A</span></div>
<ol class="prose" start="2">
<li>Size the conductor from the current. Six amps per square millimetre is what this installation works to.</li>
</ol>
